      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "One hundred and sixty eight IHD patients were studied by a \"level of neurotization\" (LN) scale, the Mini-Mult and the original rating scale. Of them, 76 were followed-up for 1-4 mont. The obtained data indicated validity and reliability of the LN scale which can be used successfully as an additional method for measurement of level for psychic state change evaluation."},
